{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multiprofile RNA-only model using transformer aggregation instead of avgpool, building on the prior multiprofile baseline (config_002). Validation accuracy (0.5191) and F1 (0.4797) are lower than config_002's 0.5907 accuracy and 0.5727 F1, suggesting transformer aggregation may not improve performance in this context. Uncertainty remains about the optimal aggregation strategy and potential benefits of integrating image modalities, as this configuration excludes image encoders and fusion mechanisms."
}

